/**
 * AIO.IFTA — IFTA / FUEL TAX. The canonical, deepest proof of the Workspace Experience Brain.
 *
 * Grounded in AIO structure (read-only): serviceCatalog `ifta-reg` (LIMITED_PILOT) + `ifta-filing` (PREPARING,
 * quarterly, quote_required, documentsRequired), data/services.ts requirements (fuel purchase records, mileage by
 * jurisdiction), fleet/ifta/iftaReadiness.ts (MileageSourceType, IftaReadinessStatus, assessIftaReadiness),
 * vault/vaultTaxonomy.ts (`tax_fuel`), infrastructure/serviceActivation.ts (`fuel-tax`: INTERNAL_ONLY — staff
 * workflow, manual filing; no direct government integration), bookkeepingConfig (IFTA bookkeeping support ≠ filing).
 *
 * Client flow: QUARTER → COLLECT → REVIEW → RECONCILE → APPROVE → FILED → VAULT (→ next quarter).
 */
